UPDATE companies SET description='KCM Cable & Manufacturing operates from Tooele, Utah, about forty minutes west of Salt Lake City.

The shop produces wire harnesses and cable assemblies covering power, signal, coaxial, and RF configurations across a wide range of connector families — from military-spec circulars (MIL-DTL-38999, 5015, 26482) to industrial, board-level, and automotive connectors. Work flows from prototype and first-article builds through repeat production, with in-house cutting, crimping, shield termination, routing, testing to IPC/WHMA-A-620 classes, and documentation.

Customers span aerospace and defense, space and satellite, robotics and autonomy, medical devices, semiconductor and test equipment, data center and power infrastructure, industrial and energy, agriculture and heavy equipment, marine and subsea, mining, and automotive aftermarket. The company also accepts inquiries from any sector that requires wired interconnects.

KCM emphasizes hands-on manufacturing paired with organized processes and clear communication, aiming to make complex cable work easier to understand, quote, and build. It offers design input at the quote stage, accepts customer-supplied or consigned material, and welcomes facility visits.', certifications=ARRAY['ITAR']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Wire harness assembly", "Cable assembly (power, signal, coax, RF)", "Prototype and first-article manufacturing", "Production manufacturing", "Design for manufacturability (DFM) consultation", "Material sourcing and procurement", "Customer-supplied material integration", "Testing and inspection to IPC/WHMA-A-620", "Documentation and traceability", "Shield termination", "Crimping and connector termination", "Harness routing and layout"], "industries": ["Aerospace & Defense", "Space & Satellite", "Robotics & Autonomy", "Medical Devices", "Semiconductor & Test", "Data Center & Power", "Industrial & Energy", "Agriculture & Heavy Equipment", "Marine & Subsea", "Mining", "Automotive Aftermarket"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to production", "lead_time": "Quoted per project based on material availability, workmanship, documentation, and test requirements", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Hands-on manufacturing with organized processes and clear communication", "Prototype and first-article builds with test and documentation before repeat production", "Design-for-manufacturability feedback provided at quote", "No fixed minimum order quantity; single prototypes accepted", "Customer-supplied or KCM-sourced material flexibility"], "facts_used": ["Location: Tooele, Utah -> /", "Address: 1220 N 80 E, Suite 13, Tooele, UT 84074 -> /", "Phone:  -> /", "Products: wire harnesses, cable assemblies, prototype to production -> /", "Connector families: MIL-DTL-38999, MIL-DTL-5015, MIL-DTL-26482, Amphenol, Glenair, etc. -> /", "Capabilities: wire harnesses, cable assemblies, prototype to production, DFM input, 