UPDATE companies SET description='Kimmie Candy Company was founded in 2000 by Joe Dutra, a third-generation farmer, in Sacramento, California. In 2005 Dutra relocated the business to Reno, Nevada, where a 47,000-square-foot facility became fully operational by 2008. International sales began the following year.

The Reno plant produces a range of chocolate confections, including the signature ChocoRocks and the protein-fortified WheyBetter Crisps. Operations cover contract manufacturing and private-label work, with the facility equipped for small-batch runs as well as large-scale production. The production floor includes dedicated areas such as a chocolate lentil station, a candy carousel room, a color-coating lab, a hot chocolate room, and a nut-roasting zone. Headcount has grown from seven at the move to 47 employees today.

Kimmie Candy serves wholesale distributors, retail chains, and brands seeking custom confections for corporate gifting or special events. Its wholesale program supplies peanut-free, gluten-free, kosher, organic, non-GMO, and fair-trade certified treats to stores.

The business was built on Dutra''s desire to create American manufacturing jobs and to offer allergen-conscious, ethically sourced candy. The company highlights its SQF-certified food-safety system, fair-trade sourcing, and two decades of contract-manufacturing experience as key differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY['SQF','Fair Trade','Kosher','Organic','Non-GMO']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Contract manufacturing", "Private label production", "Custom confection development", "Small-batch production", "Large-scale production", "Chocolate molding", "Panning", "Color coating", "Nut roasting", "Food safety management (SQF certified)"], "industries": ["Confectionery", "Wholesale", "Retail", "Corporate gifting", "Special events", "Foodservice"], "materials": ["Milk chocolate", "Whey protein", "Nuts", "Lentils"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Small-batch to large-scale production runs", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["\"Made in America\" labeling on all products", "Peanut-free, gluten-free, kosher, organic, non-GMO, and fair-trade certified", "Over 20 years of contract manufacturing experience", "47,000 sq. ft. state-of-the-art facility in Reno", "Flexible production from small batches to large-scale runs"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2000 by Joe Dutra in Sacramento, CA -> db", "Relocated to Reno, NV in 2005; facility operational 2008 -> db", "International sales began 2009 -> db", "47,000 sq. ft. facility in Reno -> /", "Employee count 47 -> db", "Products: ChocoRocks, WheyBetter Crisps -> /", "Contract manufacturing and private label services -> /", "Certifications: SQF, Fair Trade, Kosher, Organic, Non-GMO -> db, /", "Wholesale program for retailers -> /", "Corporate gifting and special event custom confections -> /", "Peanut-free, gluten-free attributes -> /", "LinkedIn URL -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Kimmie Candy - Chocolate Candy Manufacture", "founded_year": "2000", "employee_count": "47