UPDATE companies SET description='Lamb Energy is based in Riverside, California, and was founded in 2009. The company is certified as a Minority Business Enterprise and Woman Business Enterprise (MBE/WBE). It began as a solar installer and systems integrator serving commercial and industrial clients, later expanding into project development, financing, and long-term operations and maintenance.

