UPDATE companies SET description='Lee''s Foodservice Parts & Repairs, Inc. is based in Addison, Illinois, and has served the Midwest since 1998. The business began as the Howard Transport Company, providing delivery and warehousing for the foodservice industry, before evolving into Lee''s Oven Repair and later expanding into a full-service repair, installation, and maintenance provider for commercial kitchens.

The company repairs, installs, and maintains a wide range of commercial foodservice equipment, including ovens, fryers, ranges, grills, steamers, kettles, ice machines, refrigerators, freezers, and walk-in coolers. Technicians operate from specialized truck stock inventories and have access to over $5 million in parts, supporting a first-time fix rate that exceeds industry standards.

Lee''s serves restaurants, institutional kitchens, and facilities-management firms across the Chicago metro area, southeastern and southwestern Wisconsin, northwestern Indiana, and the Indianapolis region. Customers include large foodservice manufacturers and companies such as Facilities Services, Inc. The firm positions itself as a single source for HVAC, refrigeration, and kitchen equipment needs.

