UPDATE companies SET description='Leonard Truck Outfitters operates in Princeton, West Virginia, and has been serving the area since 1963. The business began as a provider of utility trailers, truck toppers, spray-in bed liners, storage sheds, and outdoor buildings.

The company sells and installs a range of truck accessories, trailers, and storage buildings. It carries brands such as LEER truck caps, BAK and Roll-N-Lock tonneau covers, and WeatherTech floor mats. Services include trailer hitch installation, spray-in bed liner application, trailer repair and parts, and shed delivery and setup. The Princeton location at 200 Expert Circle also offers financing for trailers and rent-to-own options for sheds. Additional stores operate in Beckley, West Virginia, and Blacksburg and Roanoke, Virginia.

The shop outfits Ford, Dodge, Ram, Toyota, GMC, Chevrolet, and Nissan trucks, and provides volume pricing for fleet customers. Trailer lines cover utility, cargo, dump, equipment, car hauler, ATV, livestock, and flatbed models. Shed offerings span wooden, metal, and vinyl structures, including garages, carports, and animal shelters.

