UPDATE companies SET description='Live Wire Solar, operating as Live Wire Electrical Services LLC, is a family-owned electrical contracting and solar installation company based in Ham Lake, Minnesota, within the Twin Cities metro area. The business traces its roots to 2000 when it began as an electrical contractor, adding solar photovoltaic installation in 2009. The company remains locally owned and operated, distinguishing itself from out-of-state sales firms.

Its scope extends to Level 2 EV charger installation, battery energy storage systems (as a certified LG installer), backup generator consultation and installation, and ongoing system monitoring. The team also assists customers with navigating tax credits, utility rebates, grants, and financing options.

Live Wire serves homeowners, businesses, and farms across Minnesota and western Wisconsin. Projects range from rooftop arrays to ground-mounted installations, with the company citing work for residential customers, commercial properties, and agricultural operations. The company''s portfolio includes installations for clients seeking to reduce carbon emissions and energy costs, supported by incentive programs such as the federal ITC, USDA REAP grants, and utility-specific rebates.

Founded on a mission to accelerate renewable energy adoption, Live Wire emphasizes local presence, NABCEP-certified installers, and a licensed, bonded, and insured operation. The company highlights its ability to tailor designs to specific roof layouts and aesthetic requirements, as well as its responsiveness during supply-chain disruptions, as factors that set it apart.', certifications=ARRAY['NABCEP','LG Certified Installer','General Contractor License']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar PV system design and installation", "EV charger installation (Level 2)", "Battery energy storage system installation", "Backup generator consultation and installation", "Solar system monitoring and analytics", "Incentive navigation and financing assistance", "Electrical contracting", "General contracting"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Agricultural", "Renewable energy"], "materials": ["Solar panels (Solaria PowerXT)", "LG battery storage systems", "Level 2 EV chargers"], "equipment": ["LG battery storage systems", "Solaria PowerXT solar panels"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded 2000 -> db", "Family-owned -> /about-us", "Headquarters Ham Lake, Minnesota -> db", "Electrical contractors since 2000 -> /about-us", "Solar installers since 2009 -> /about-us", "NABCEP-certified -> /about-us, /", "Licensed general contractors -> /about-us", "Licensed, bonded, insured -> /about-us, /", "Full-service EPC solar contractor -> /about-us", "Services: solar PV, EV charging, energy storage, generator, monitoring -> /", "Incentive navigation assistance -> /", "Industries: residential, commercial, agricultural -> /about-us", "Certified LG installer -> /", "Mission to accelerate renewable energy adoption -> /", "Local ownership emphasis -> /", "Solaria PowerXT panels used -> / (testimonial)", "Level 2 EV chargers -> /", "LG battery storage -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "t