UPDATE companies SET description='Logo Work Gloves LLC, based in Monument, Colorado, was founded in 1992 as a family-owned business. The company began with a focus on providing custom logo printing on work gloves for businesses across the United States, building a reputation for quality hand protection that carries a customer’s brand.

The company specializes in private-label promotional gloves, offering custom printing on a range of styles including cotton, leather (cowhide and pigskin), fleece, winter insulated, dipped (nitrile foam and smooth), mechanic, and driver gloves. Using premium materials and precise printing methods, they ensure logos resist fading, peeling, or cracking. Operations are supported by a staff of 51–200 employees, and the company reports more than one million gloves sold since inception. An online ordering system provides free digital proofs before production.

Customers include companies outfitting crews with branded uniforms, organizations seeking trade-show giveaways, and firms like The Driving Company, which uses the gloves for off-road training safety and brand visibility. The gloves are also marketed for individual consumers needing personalized winter or work gloves.

The company differentiates itself through its “Handshake Guarantee,” promising to work with customers until they are satisfied. Founded on the slogan “They’ll know you like the back of their hand,” Logo Work Gloves emphasizes keeping the client’s logo front and center, combining durable hand protection with lasting brand exposure.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom logo printing on work gloves", "Private labeling", "Custom color matching", "Personalized cuff text (names, titles, numbers)", "Free digital proof before production", "Online ordering"], "industries": ["Construction", "Corporate promotional products", "Off-road driver training", "Trucking/transportation", "Industrial safety", "Trade shows and events", "Uniform programs"], "materials": ["Cotton", "Leather (cowhide, pigskin)", "Fleece", "Winter insulated fabrics", "Nitrile (foam and smooth)", "Synthetic blends for mechanic gloves"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Handshake Guarantee \u2013 satisfaction guaranteed or they\u2019ll make it right", "Private-label expertise for promotional work gloves", "Premium materials and printing methods that resist fading, peeling, cracking", "Family-owned since 1992 with over 1 million gloves sold", "Free digital proof before production"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1992 -> db, /about-us", "Family-owned -> /about-us", "Headquarters in Monument, Colorado -> db", "Employee count 51-200 -> db", "Over 1 million gloves sold -> /about-us", "Custom logo printing on work gloves -> description, /", "Private labeling specialization -> /about-us", "Handshake Guarantee -> /, /about-us", "Glove types: cotton, leather, fleece, winter, dipped, mechanic, driver -> /", "Industries served: construction, corporate giveaways, off-road driver training, trucking -> / testimonials", "Premium materials and precise printing methods -> /", "Free PDF proof -> /", "Fast delivery -> /", "Online ordering -> /", "Slogan: