UPDATE companies SET description='M&I Electric, LLC operates from Beaumont, Texas, where it was established in 1946. The company functions as part of the Myers Power Products group, a collection of businesses that manufacture engineered-to-order and standard medium- and low-voltage power distribution equipment for public and private sector customers. Over seven decades, the business has grown from its founding into a supplier of custom power delivery solutions for the global energy industry.

The company designs and builds custom medium- and low-voltage switchgear, arc-resistant switchgear, bus duct systems, motor control centers, AC and DC drives, power distribution centers, and automation control systems. Its capabilities include in-house engineering, custom manufacturing, and a quality management system certified to ISO 9001:2015. In addition to equipment production, M&I Electric provides technical field services such as acceptance testing, startup services, high- and low-voltage testing, generator testing, preventative maintenance, repair, and substation and power delivery testing.

M&I Electric serves the oil and gas sector across upstream, midstream, and downstream operations, as well as power generation and distribution, marine, and general industrial markets. Customers include energy companies that require engineered power distribution equipment for demanding industrial and marine applications worldwide.

The company emphasizes a collaborative, customer-driven approach: client input shapes product design at key milestones, and its processes aim to deliver unique solutions in a uniform, repeatable manner. This focus on tailoring equipment to specific requirements, combined with lifelong support and post-warranty service, is presented as the core differentiator.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom manufacturing", "In-house engineering", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system", "Electrical system acceptance testing", "Startup services", "Generator testing", "High voltage testing", "Low voltage testing", "Preventative maintenance and repair", "Substation and power delivery testing", "Maintenance contracts"], "industries": ["Oil and gas", "Upstream oil and gas", "Midstream oil and gas", "Downstream oil and gas", "Power generation and distribution", "Marine", "Industrial"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Customer-driven solutions shaped by collaborative feedback at project milestones", "In-house engineering paired with custom manufacturing for engineered-to-order equipment", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system", "Comprehensive technical field services including testing, maintenance, and startup support", "Post-warranty support and standalone service offerings for in-service equipment"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Beaumont, Texas -> db", "Founded 1946 -> /quality", "Part of Myers Power Products group -> /", "ISO 9001:2015 certified -> /quality, db", "Products: low/medium voltage switchgear, arc-resistant switchgear, bus duct, MCCs, drives, power distribution centers, automation control systems -> db", "Industries: oil & gas (upstream/midstream/downstream), power generation, marine, industrial -> /, db", "Capabilities: custom manufacturing, in-house engineering, field services (testing, maintenance, startup) -> /, /quality", "Quality